### 전체 메뉴 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/menus

### 상세 메뉴 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/menus/9002

### 메뉴 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuName": "까르보나라",
  "menuPrice": 14000,
  "categoryCode": 4,
  "orderableStatus": "Y"
}

### 메뉴 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/menus/9002
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuName": "베이컨 까르보나라",
  "menuPrice": "16000",
  "categoryCode": 4,
  "orderableStatus": "Y"
}

### 메뉴 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/menus/9002